from mkchar import write
write("Travis_Noble","Travis Noble","0 for Books 6-9; 2 for Books 12-13","6","13","Books 6, 7, 12, 13 (chapter files)","Farrah_Hurin.md, Jason_Asano.md, ../05_Organisations/Earth_Powers.md",
 "A young American magitech engineer who joins Jason and Farrah, becomes a diamond-ranker and co-builds the Sky Link Network.",
 "- At twenty-one he is a category-two magitech weapons engineer from California who ends up in charge of the Special Munition Stockpile Division in Germany (Book 6, Ch28 L36-37).\n- He works on the semi-disassembled atomic device with Jason and Farrah on a cold winter day (Book 6, Ch31 L4).\n- In Book 7 he waits at a Geller country estate with Taika, complaining that most magitech is \"heavy on the tech and light on the magic\" (Book 7, Ch44 L61-62).\n- Farrah says he is still working out of Rimaros on cloud flask research with House de Varco (Book 12, Ch12 L75) and that he introduced chosen pronouns to the gold- and diamond-rankers (Book 12, Ch12 L82).\n- At the Book 12 reunion Travis, Constance and Emir share a table while Jason meets an angry Cloudweaver (Book 12, Ch14 L61-63).\n- By Book 13 he is lead researcher of the Joint Magitech Weapons Research Institute (Book 13, Ch995 L14).",
 "Wry, quick and a little overwhelmed; his engineering instincts keep up with gods and diamond-rankers.")
write("Estella_Warnock","Estella Warnock","0 for Books 7-10; 2 for Book 13","7","13","Books 7, 8, 9, 10, 13 (chapter files)","Belinda_Callahan.md, Jason_Asano.md",
 "A Livaros spy and scout with fourfold senses who works for Jason's team and later marries Belinda.",
 "- She has \"made a career out of being a spy and urban scout in Livaros\" and knows the island's streets, alleys and rooftops extremely well (Book 8, Ch5 L7).\n- In Book 7 she waits on a roof in a small town, failing to concentrate on a book while a monster manifestation is expected (Book 7, Ch62 L79); she tells a contact she would rather keep her identity from someone who \"doesn't know who I am\" (Book 7, Ch62 L41).\n- She is beside Jason at the gate of Yaresh (Book 9, Ch43 L33).\n- Jason says her \"fourfold senses make her even better than I am\" at spotting messenger agents, and that she is an experienced spy (Book 10, Ch42 L41); she maps the messenger agents in the city (Book 10, Ch42 L39).\n- By Book 13 she is Belinda's wife (Book 13, Ch1011 L23).",
 "Cautious, observant and hard to surprise; she prefers not to be noticed.")
write("Natalie_Park","Natalie Park","2","13","13","Book 13 (chapter files)","Lenora_Coleman.md, Holly_Macrossan.md, Jason_Asano.md",
 "An ASIS agent assigned as Jason's liaison during the 2038 events.",
 "- An ASIS agent and silver-ranker, she was a young girl at Jason's last visit and was trained on Farrah's and Rufus's methods (Book 13, Ch961 L8).\n- The junior ASIS officer with \"the unenviable position of personal liaison to Jason Asano\" in the Asano Village briefing room (Book 13, Ch969 L88).\n- Manages the video feeds in the briefing room (Book 13, Ch970 L52); Jason startles her by rising from her shadow (Book 13, Ch974 L31).\n- Pays half attention at the symposium after realising who is sitting next to her (Book 13, Ch995 L69).\n- States that it has been more than four years since a confirmed trace of McKean (Book 13, Ch998 L105).",
 "Professional and wary; she is learning how to work beside someone the rest of the world cannot control.")
write("Holly_Macrossan","Holly Macrossan","2","13","13","Book 13 (chapter files)","Anna_Tilden.md, Lenora_Coleman.md, ../05_Organisations/Earth_Powers.md",
 "Anna Tilden's successor at the UN Office of Supernatural Affairs, later liaison to the Multinational Supernatural Response Taskforce.",
 "- Succeeded Annabeth Tilden as Under-Secretary-General of the United Nations Office of Supernatural Affairs (Book 13, Ch982 L30).\n- Anna recommended her as successor, having kept an eye on her while Anna ran the Sydney branch (Book 13, Ch988 L52-54).\n- After losing her UN position she took a post with the Australian government as \"Liaison to the Multinational Supernatural Response Taskforce for the Department of Prime Minister and Cabinet\", and sits in the Asano Village conference room (Book 13, Ch994 L39).\n- She maintains a sceptical mindset despite two decades of magic (Book 13, Ch982 L30).",
 "Dry, careful and practical; she believes only what she can verify.")
write("Velius","Velius","3","3","13","Books 3, 11, 13 (chapter files)","Raythe.md, Shako.md, ../02_Cosmology_and_Powers/Great_Astral_Beings.md",
 "A tall celestine diamond-ranker, the prime vessel of the Reaper.",
 "- \"A tall celestine, with dark skin and a bushy mound of curly, silver hair that matched his eyes\" (Book 3, Ch69 L238); Shako greets him warmly in the dome chamber (Book 3, Ch69 L233-237).\n- He says he made the mistake of getting his descendants out of trouble again and again until he washed his hands of them (Book 3, Ch69 L245).\n- When he and Shako change, the Reaper speaks through Velius and the voice becomes cold (Book 3, Ch69 L250-251).\n- In Book 11 he says the Builder is done with Pallimustus (Book 11, Ch22 L11); Raythe and Velius lead the descent of peak diamond-rankers into the shaft (Book 11, Ch61 L8).\n- Lord Velius is \"the prime vessel of my progenitor\", the Reaper (Book 11, Ch64 L9).",
 "Warm and wry in person; chilling when the Reaper speaks through him.")
write("Raythe","Raythe","3","9","13","Books 9, 11, 12 (chapter files)","Velius.md, ../02_Cosmology_and_Powers/Great_Astral_Beings.md",
 "A prime vessel of the Keeper of Moments who steps in on Jason's behalf.",
 "- In Yaresh she answers a challenge: \"I am Raythe, and I have told you as much of my intentions as you need to know. Leave or die\" (Book 9, Ch97 L80).\n- She asks whether the Reaper did not tell Velius why they have come (Book 11, Ch22 L12); Raythe and Velius are the peak diamond-rankers from beyond Pallimustus (Book 11, Ch61 L8).\n- \"Lady Raythe is, indeed, the prime vessel of the Keeper of Moments\" (Book 11, Ch64 L9); she tells Jason that only the nameless will stand with the World-Phoenix against him (Book 11, Ch65 L55).\n- After the great beings leave, Raythe alone remains; the time there is synchronised with Jason's universe while the castle stays connected (Book 12, Ch1 L5-11); she tells Jason he will see her again (Book 12, Ch2 L9).",
 "Calm, precise and amused; she says little more than the situation requires.")
